omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr8-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gyWphOn9JM4Q7kNvwFdAu1a&_nc_oc=AdpgDoRtO1EW6I8D_A21hsMYmHmtVWVEC2ByGhpYy8Y0pet0LP8JFdFNhfeiPZPA3oQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr8-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0VTQ2X80lXGy_0akKNOzXQQuQcmUDSG83XQnLxzRqkww&oe=69E25034"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr8-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LjfXvRvxYIAQ7kNvwEQfFRB&_nc_oc=Adr_gLezCIUnPJgB_McGSG0JqbEAHzvxKkjap8expbx3lIZjvGdywJ6AARRnmq7z8YI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr8-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3T7nRcqUbZZDGBZIYsfCiaYAX1ZOS_wb_x_agKlc-ttQ&oe=69E25196"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KXvGffVLwNkQ7kNvwHFAU1M&_nc_oc=AdprAIdyRM1QW7ZuQsFtsxspLrfmsIr22KhZzTb4d6hhTiqllYELG_2UIvFsUBQAlJQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3X3h0ALhvsatNZTolXOyTg2xqLdf_fERNZ5dT8tmbTKg&oe=69E22E77"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://